# Icon sheet 3, 2026-10-26: shield, gate, damage, skull, rations, bell, train, reassign, close, book.
# 12x12, ink outline, light from the upper left. Research notes: ../README.md

# Fighters. A heater shield: flat top, sides curving to a point; steel rim, army slate-blue field,
# a gold diamond charge.
